{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-figure-eight-reeb-rotation-reeb-reading","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:figure-eight-reeb-rotation-reeb-reading","kind":"remark","title":"The figure-eight phase as a q-Reeb rotation between the two lepton channels","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-figure-eight-reeb-rotation"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-figure-eight-reeb-rotation","tags":["figure-eight","reeb-flow","interpretation"],"text":"figure-eight-reeb-rotation-reeb-reading.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:figure-eight-reeb-rotation-reeb-reading\"></a><p>The phase <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\theta</code> of <a href=\"figure-eight-reeb-rotation.md\">prop:figure-eight-reeb-rotation</a> is read as the accumulated <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Reeb rotation angle. Restricted to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_2(q)</code>, the representation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_{(2,1)}</code> splits into the two one-dimensional channels <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_{(2)}</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_{(1,1)}</code>, which are the two lines of the seminormal basis on which <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1</code> acts by <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-q^{-1}</code>. In this reading these are the two lepton channels, and the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Reeb flow rotates between them. The angle <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\theta</code> is then the natural invariant of this mixing.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/figure-eight-reeb-rotation-reeb-reading.md","heading":"Remark","number":"7.10.19","page":"b/rem-figure-eight-reeb-rotation-reeb-reading"}
